---
title: "liquidate (Current Finance: Liquidation)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_pre_check: pre_liquidation_check(app, cap, market, liquidation_permission)
    q_pre_check --> q_check_collateral_type: assert collateral can_be_collateral
    q_check_collateral_type --> q_check_liq_pause: assert !liquidation_paused
    q_check_liq_pause --> q_build_params: build LiquidationParams(incentive, revenue_factor, close_factor)
    q_build_params --> q_check_repay: assert available_repay_coin.value != 0
    q_check_repay --> q_refresh: refresh_obligation_assets_interest(all, now)
    q_refresh --> q_ensure_allowed: ensure_liquidate_borrow_allowed
    q_ensure_allowed --> q_check_unhealthy: risk_level gt 1.0 (or overridden ltv)
    q_check_unhealthy --> q_check_close: repay lte close_factor * total_debt_value
    q_check_close --> q_cap_repay: cap repay to obligation debt ceiling
    q_cap_repay --> q_calc_seize: seized_ctokens = calc based on exchange_rate, incentive, prices
    q_calc_seize --> q_check_enough_ctoken: total_ctokens lt seized?
    q_check_enough_ctoken --> q_adjust: adjust repay proportionally
    q_check_enough_ctoken --> q_repay_debt: obligation.unsafe_repay_debt_only(repay_amount)
    q_adjust --> q_repay_debt
    q_repay_debt --> q_seize: obligation.withdraw_ctokens(seized)
    q_seize --> q_liquidate_ctokens: reserve.liquidate_ctokens(ctoken, revenue_factor)
    q_liquidate_ctokens --> q_protocol_fee: protocol_seize = revenue_factor * redeem_amount
    q_protocol_fee --> q_update_emode: emode_group.update_asset_borrow(old, new)
    q_update_emode --> q_debt_reserve_repay: debt_reserve.repay_amount(repay_coin)
    q_debt_reserve_repay --> q_try_stop_adl: try_stop ADL (borrow + collateral)
    q_try_stop_adl --> q_post: post_liquidation (mining + event)
    q_post --> q_transfer: transfer collateral + refund to liquidator
    q_transfer --> [*]

    note right of q_ensure_allowed
        INV-001: Obligation must be unhealthy (risk gt 1.0) to be liquidated
        INV-002: close_factor limits max liquidation amount per call
        INV-003: close_factor_bypass allows full liquidation below min_value threshold
        INV-004: liquidation_incentive rewards liquidator with extra collateral
        INV-005: liquidation_revenue_factor skims protocol fee from seized collateral
        INV-006: PackageCallerCap required (whitelisted liquidators only)
    end note
